OL,3,GNEWSADead ducks found at park amid
OL,4,Abotulism concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA safety warning has been issued after
OL,7,Ffive dead ducks were discovered at a
OL,8,Fpark in Kent.
OL,10,FTunbridge Wells Borough Council said
OL,11,Fthe birds were found at Dunorlan Park -
OL,12,Fand urged dog-walkers to keep their
OL,13,Fpets away from the water.
OL,15,F"As a precaution, signage has been
OL,16,Fdisplayed advising visitors not to
OL,17,Ftouch dead or sick birds and to report
OL,18,Fthem immediately to the parks team," a
OL,19,Fcouncil spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
