OL,3,GNEWSADead ducks found at park amid
OL,4,Abotulism concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The prolonged period of hot, dry
OL,7,Fweather and reduced water levels has
OL,8,Fled to an increased risk of avian
OL,9,Fbotulism at a number of locations
OL,10,Fnationally."
